g the words.\n\nThe room becomes tense as both students are deeply engaged in the argument. \n\nJAMIE\n(convincing)\nLook, I'm not saying we throw away all the rules. I'm suggesting a world where we have a higher level of respect and understanding that goes beyond just the formality of asking.\n\nAs the camera pulls back, showing both students sitting on the edge of a bed, the tension is palpable. The room is quiet, and the audience is left to consider Jamie's argument."
